  "details": "Whenever I get in mood to play VRChat- I have to type my email and password using VR controllers which takes forever to type. And then I have to remove VR headset to get on computer to get my email code to log on. This happens every month and it's becoming very tedious and annoying. Please give us a option to stay logged on VRChat whenever we launch the game, please. I want this more than anything else in VRChat, I'm not kidding. Please consider making it happen!",
